\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Illustration of Metropolis-Hastings MCMC sampling over Datalog program space. The current program evolves through add/remove/swap proposals, with acceptance probability min(1, exp(-$\Delta $E/T)). The energy landscape shows lower energy regions corresponding to higher-quality programs.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig2}{{2}{6}{Illustration of Metropolis-Hastings MCMC sampling over Datalog program space. The current program evolves through add/remove/swap proposals, with acceptance probability min(1, exp(-$\Delta $E/T)). The energy landscape shows lower energy regions corresponding to higher-quality programs}{figure.2}{}}
