\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Results from the FOL fragment quality pilot experiment on RuleTaker data. The multi-stage validation pipeline achieved 100\% valid fragment rate (60/60 fragments), exceeding the 70\% threshold. Semantic diversity was limited with mock LLM responses (mean pairwise cosine distance = 0.0079), indicating the need for real LLM deployment.}}{9}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig4}{{4}{9}{Results from the FOL fragment quality pilot experiment on RuleTaker data. The multi-stage validation pipeline achieved 100\% valid fragment rate (60/60 fragments), exceeding the 70\% threshold. Semantic diversity was limited with mock LLM responses (mean pairwise cosine distance = 0.0079), indicating the need for real LLM deployment}{figure.4}{}}
